Package: smartune-monitor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Intel Corporation <smartune@intel.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, openssl, xdg-utils, policykit-1|polkitd, curl
Recommends: cpuid, msr-tools
Description: Intel XPU SmarTune Monitor
 Telemetry and system-pressure monitoring dashboard for Intel XPU platforms.
 .
 Installs a desktop launcher (application menu + desktop icon) that starts the
 monitor service on demand and opens the dashboard in the default browser at
 https://localhost:9001. Not started at boot; runs only while in use.
